# 8. ENUMERATION

Enumeration asks:

```text
What systems exist?
What ports are open?
What services run?
What versions exist?
What accounts exist?
What permissions exist?
```

Common tools:

- Nmap
- DNS tools
- LDAP tools
- BloodHound
- Web proxies/scanners

