# 16. CREDENTIAL ATTACK REVISION

### Password Spraying

Few passwords → many accounts.

### Brute Force

Many passwords → one account.

### Kerberoasting

SPN/service account → service-ticket material → offline guessing.

### AS-REP Roasting

No Kerberos preauthentication → AS response → offline guessing.

### Pass-the-Hash

Reuse NTLM hash.

### Pass-the-Ticket

Reuse Kerberos ticket.

